<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Benchmark Language Coverage</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Benchmarking Result Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Bitext Mining Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Cross-Lingual Transfer under Limited Target-Language Data Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Monolingual Benchmarking Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Continual Pre-Training: Representation Similarity</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Parallel Tokenizers: Rethinking Vocabulary Designfor Cross-Lingual Transfer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Model Input Representation Design</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
